# Society Management System — Complete Implementation Plan v2

## Goal

Build a **complete Society Management Platform** inside LocalSampark with **15 features** across **3 role-based views**:

| Role | Access |
|---|---|
| **Society Admin** | Full control — members, bills, settings, analytics, notices, polls, amenities |
| **Security Guard** | Visitor logging with photos, staff attendance, package logging, reminders |
| **Resident (Flat Owner)** | Doorbell alerts, approve/decline visitors, bills, complaints, bookings, polls, directory |

