## Design Decisions

- **Photo Storage**: Base64 data URIs stored directly in SQLite (per user's approval)
- **Reminder Scheduling**: 30-second `setInterval` check (per user's approval)
- **No Tailwind**: All UI uses existing `globals.css` classes (`glass-card`, `btn-primary`, `form-input`, etc.)
- **Single Page**: All 15 features on one page with tab navigation (keeps codebase manageable)
- **Role Detection**: Auto-detects user role from `society_members` table — shows appropriate tabs
- **Webcam**: Native `getUserMedia()` API — works on both desktop (webcam) and mobile (camera)

